Pipeline invariant অপরিবর্তিত: identical synthetic exchanges-এ প্রতিটি NEW/VANISHED manifest-এ listed operation-এ থাকতে হবে। শুধু attribution call-এ explicit `mode='replay'` যোগ হয়েছে (`08_experiments/tools/test_pipeline.py:109`)। Final pipeline counts: REQUEST_LOOSE 419 mutated ops, NEW 0/VANISHED 31; REQUEST_STRICT 569, 2052/0; RESPONSE_ORACLE 465, 2972/0; METHOD_SEM 407, 406/582। Evidence: `09_collab/logs/T10_scratch/test_pipeline.txt:3`। ⚠️ এই PASS locality যাচাই করে; generator validity, causal SUT correctness বা complete OAS support প্রমাণ করে না (`08_experiments/tools/test_pipeline.py:1`, `:24`; R21 উপরে)।

**নতুন P001 ফল।** নতুন outputs: `08_experiments/E1_pilot/p001_results_v2/{oas_violation_types,developer_response,replay_agreement,constraint_agreement}.csv` ও `summary.json`; source/schema fields ও metric calculation: `08_experiments/E1_pilot/p001_oas_analysis.py:144`। পুরোনো `reproduced_default/strict` columns-এর নাম এখন `category_redetected_default/strict`; নতুন `constraint_total`, `constraint_matched_*`, `constraint_agreed_any_*`, `constraint_agreed_all_*` এবং per-constraint `matched_*`/`evidence_*` আছে (`p001_oas_analysis.py:181`)।

| Metric | Default | Strict | Evidence |
|---|---:|---:|---|
| F_OAS category-level re-detection | 63/73 | 72/73 | `p001_results_v2/summary.json:114` |
| F_OAS: অন্তত একটি source constraint identity মেলে | 63/73 | 72/73 | `p001_results_v2/summary.json:122` |
| F_OAS: সব source constraint identity মেলে | 44/73 | 62/73 | `p001_results_v2/summary.json:122` |
| Matched unique constraint identities, fault-এর ভিতরে deduplicated | 122/299 | 201/299 | `p001_results_v2/summary.json:125` |
| Additional-property fault-এর broad category hit | 18/27 | 27/27 | `p001_results_v2/summary.json:134` |
| Additional-property fault-এ অন্তত একটি সঠিক keyword/location/property hit | 0/27 | 27/27 | `p001_results_v2/summary.json:138` |
| Individual additional-property identities মেলে | 0/165 | 79/165 | `09_collab/logs/T10_scratch/verification.json`, `constraint_counts_by_keyword.additionalProperties` |
| F_2XXP category hit | 30/44 | 30/44 | `p001_results_v2/summary.json:86` |
